msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD\",\"homepage.po\",\"\",\"27908:100\",\"6f6a7a9ec19c649ca4b10144\"]"
msgid ""
"Until version 1.0, FreeCAD had a built-in Arch workbench and\n"
"              an external BIM workbench added on top of that. With version 1.0, both of them have\n"
"              merged and now we have a built-in BIM workbench. Now you can do your building and\n"
"              construction related projects right out of the box."
msgstr ""
"Fram till version 1.0 hade FreeCAD en\n"
"              inbyggd Arch-arbetsbänk och en extern BIM-arbetsbänk som byggde vidare på den. \n"
"              I version 1.0 slogs de samman till en inbyggd BIM-arbetsbänk. \n"
"              Nu kan du arbeta med bygg- och konstruktionsprojekt direkt."

