msgid ""
"Upgrades the selected objects into more complex shapes.\n"
"The result of the operation depends on the types of objects, which may be able to be upgraded several times in a row.\n"
"For example, it can join the selected objects into one, convert simple edges into parametric polylines,\n"
"convert closed edges into filled faces and parametric polygons, and merge faces into a single face."
msgstr ""
"Uppgraderar de valda objekten till mer komplexa former.\n"
"Resultatet av operationen beror på typen av objekt, som kanske kan uppgraderas flera gånger i rad.\n"
"Den kan t.ex. sammanfoga de markerade objekten till ett, konvertera enkla kanter till parametriska polylinjer,\n"
"konvertera slutna kanter till fyllda ytor och parametriska polygoner, och sammanfoga ytor till en enda yta."

