msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD\",\"draft.ts\",\"DxfImportDialog\",\"548:1560\",\"dbb9642345bacf5916d4930d\"]"
msgid ""
"Creates parametric Part objects (e.g., Part::Line, Part::Circle). Block\n"
"definitions are imported as reusable objects (Part Compounds) and instances\n"
"become `App::Link` objects, maintaining the block structure. Best for\n"
"script-based post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Skapar parametriska Part-objekt (till exempel Part::Line och Part::Circle). Blockdefinitioner\n"
"importeras som återanvändbara objekt (sammansatta Part-objekt) och instanser\n"
"blir `App::Link`-objekt, vilket bevarar blockstrukturen. Bäst för\n"
"skriptbaserad efterbearbetning."

