msgctxt "[\"FreeCAD\",\"homepage.po\",\"\",\"27908:94\",\"f59849b587ba081649ac195b\"]"
msgid ""
"FreeCAD features an advanced geometry engine based on\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Open_CASCADE>Open CASCADE Technology</a>. It supports solids,\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boundary_representation>Boundary Representation</a> (BRep) objects, and\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Non-uniform_rational_B-spline>Non-uniform rational basis spline</a> (NURBS)\n"
"              curves and surfaces, and offers a wide range of tools to create and modify these objects, including complex\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boolean_operations_on_polygons>Boolean</a> operations,\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fillet_(mechanics)>fillets</a>, shape cleaning and\n"
"              <a href=https://wiki.freecad.org/OpenCASCADE>much more</a>."
msgstr ""
"FreeCAD har en avancerad geometrimotor baserad på\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Open_CASCADE>Open CASCADE Technology</a>. Den stöder solider,\n"
"              objekt med <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boundary_representation>randrepresentation</a> (BRep) samt kurvor och ytor baserade på\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Non-uniform_rational_B-spline>icke-uniforma rationella B-splines</a> (NURBS).\n"
"              Det finns många verktyg för att skapa och ändra dessa objekt, bland annat komplexa\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boolean_operations_on_polygons>booleska</a> operationer,\n"
"              <a href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fillet_(mechanics)>avrundningar</a>, formrensning och\n"
"              <a href=https://wiki.freecad.org/OpenCASCADE>mycket mer</a>."

